              <div class="chat-bubble user-bubble">
                <p>My 2021 Civic has a battery warning light and the steering feels heavy.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="chat-bubble ai-bubble">
                <p class="ai-text">
                  DTC P0562 detected: Low system voltage. On the 2021 Civic EX (1.5L Turbo), this indicates alternator output failure or loose serpentine belt.
                </p>

                <!-- Generative SDUI Card (Transpiled via json-to-compose) -->
