      <!-- PAIN VS RELIEF: The Setup Debt Nightmare -->
      <section class="section-block">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2 class="section-title">The Brutal Reality of Building KMP from Scratch</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">
            Every mobile engineering team that adopts Kotlin Multiplatform loses 2 to 4 weeks solving the exact same fragile build hurdles. Zora KMP eliminates them once and for all.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="comparison-grid">
          <!-- The Hard Way -->
          <div class="machined-module-card pain-card">
            <div class="card-status-header">
              <span class="status-badge badge-pain">DO IT YOURSELF FROM SCRATCH</span>
              <span class="status-time">~80+ HOURS WASTED</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="pain-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Gradle Configuration Hell:</strong> Fighting bloated <code>build.gradle.kts</code> scripts, mismatched versions, and breaking plugin updates.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Apple & Xcode Linking Failures:</strong> Spending days debugging CocoaPods / SPM framework linking, CocoaPods bridge errors, and Darwin target architectures.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Brittle Swift Interop:</strong> Manually wrapping Kotlin Coroutines and StateFlow in Swift wrappers without ergonomic <code>async/await</code> support.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Abandoned Community Libraries:</strong> Risking production apps on 3rd-party community wrappers that stop receiving updates after 6 months.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Zero Domain Relevance:</strong> Starting from an empty counter app that teaches you nothing about real-world enterprise architectures.
              </li>
            </ul>
