              <span class="status-badge badge-relief">THE ZORA KMP SHORTCUT</span>
              <span class="status-time highlight">DEPLOY IN 1 DAY</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="relief-list">
              <li>
                <strong>Declarative Kotlin Toolchain:</strong> Pure <code>module.yaml</code> configuration (<a href="https://kotlin-toolchain.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-inline">kotlin-toolchain.org</a>) eliminating thousands of lines of imperative Gradle debt.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Touchlab SKIE Pre-Configured:</strong> Native Swift <code>async/await</code> and <code>AsyncSequence</code> ergonomics for Coroutines and Flows out-of-the-box.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>100% Kotlin Foundation Backed:</strong> Exclusively engineered with official solutions from JetBrains, Google, Touchlab, Kotzilla, and Gradle.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Hybrid On-Device & Cloud AI:</strong> Gemini Nano on-device + Gemini Cloud API with dynamic Server-Driven UI via <code>json-to-compose</code>.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Battle-Tested Real Domain:</strong> Extracted directly from Zora, a multi-sided marketplace demonstrating full clean architecture.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
